<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu falls to 4.6668 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu falls to 4.6668 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu fell to 4.6668 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.66 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>					   Jan 15		 Jan 14</p>
<p> lei per dollar			4.6668		 4.6600</p>
<p> volume traded ($)		   300,000		400,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
